************ SPECIAL FORMATTED COMMENT **********
EW API FORMATTED COMMENT
TYPE LIBRARY

LIBRARY  EWDB_APPLICATIONS

SUB_LIBRARY eqparam2html

LOCATION THIS_FILE

LINK_NAME Details
LINK details.html

LINK_NAME Sample Config File
LINK eqparam2html.d.txt

LINK_NAME Programmer Notes
LINK programmer_notes.txt

DESCRIPTION <b>eqparam2html</b> generates a web-page
with parametric information about an Event as well
as a map depicting the location of the event and
surrounding stations.  It also provides links to 
other programs that allow the user to view record
sections(waveform snippets), and station information.
